Face animation
Supported terminals, including Ghostty 1.4+, can keep the face moving after smol
exits. Other terminals show a still face.

◆
│  ❯ ● Static face
│    ○ Animate after smol exits
│  ↑/↓ to navigate • Enter: confirm
└
Enter accepts; Esc back; Ctrl+C cancels

